{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mecha Shooting \u00d7 Harem Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mecha Harem: Bonds of the Abyss</i> blends thrilling bullet-hell mecha shooting with lewd H-interaction gameplay. Pilot your fighter to dodge dense bullet patterns, defeat powerful bosses, and gather fuel for your mothership\u2014the last hope of humanity in space. Bond with the beautiful heroines aboard your ship\u2026 and even the sexy female bosses you conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949900/extras/4c175ba4139e374f5b780a90b6cd3c20.poster.avif?t=1771935380\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949900/extras/4c175ba4139e374f5b780a90b6cd3c20.webm?t=1771935380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unlucky loser gets struck by lightning and finds himself isekai\u2019d into a post-apocalyptic universe. With help from girls of various professions, he boards the mothership and accepts missions to search for resources. Piloting his mecha, he fights through galaxies, defeating enemies and adding each beauty to his harem. Beat a stage boss, return to your ship, and enjoy exclusive H scenes with undressing, speed control, and position switching for maximum immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949900/extras/500a40dad556be7bd0edada10fba0260.poster.avif?t=1771935380\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949900/extras/500a40